  "name": "Pepper Steak and Rice",
  "subtitle": "Tender steak and peppers with savory rice",
  "description": "Thin-sliced sirloin cooks with onion, bell pepper, garlic, and paprika, then finishes in a lightly thickened sauce over rice.",
